From 0b8fc98c0f24fd1ae6d8fd77cd06a3c9ddd5f16a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:33:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Select V8 Windows flags by compiler driver

Regression: the Windows pointer compile-action test fails with -std=c++20 instead of /std:c++20. Preserve GNU options, use CL spellings for msvc-cl and clang-cl, and verify C++ actions for the pointer and assembly-library fixtures. Native MSVC execution remains a required hosted gate.
---
 MODULE.bazel                           |   1 +
 patches/v8_msvc_driver_flags.patch     | 190 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/build-warnings/v8/BUILD.bazel    |  12 ++
 tools/build-warnings/v8/flags_test.bzl |  30 ++++
 4 files changed, 233 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patches/v8_msvc_driver_flags.patch
 create mode 100644 tools/build-warnings/v8/flags_test.bzl

diff --git a/MODULE.bazel b/MODULE.bazel
index bf546a8c1..b2e4865d8 100644
--- a/MODULE.bazel
